an appellation of origin or a geographical indication registered under Article 16 of the Agriculture Act of 29 April 1998

 SR 910.1
	 (AgricA), or a geographical indication registered under Article 50b of this Act;

the Swiss canton that protects the appellation d’origine contrôlée or the foreign authority responsible for the regulation of wine denominations corresponding to Article 63 AgricA

 SR 910.1
	, as well as the group that obtained the protection of such a foreign wine denomination;

the international registration of a trade mark provided that Switzerland is the country of origin in accordance with Article 1 paragraph 3 of the Madrid Agreement
SR 0.232.112.3 , or Article 2 paragraph 1 of the Madrid Protocol
SR 0.232.141.4 ;

the group that has obtained the registration of the appellation of origin or the geographical indication under Article 16 or 63 AgricA

 SR 910.1
	 nor under Article 50b of this Act, or where such group no longer exists, the representative group dealing with the protection of this appellation of origin or geographical indication;
